#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(A) the excess medical expense deduction` 100 EQUALS 65
#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(A) the excess medical expense deduction` 36 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(A) the excess medical expense deduction` 35 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(A) the excess medical expense deduction` 34 EQUALS 0
