#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(B)(i) the State agency must offer the method of claiming recurring medical expenses` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(B)(ii) the method conforms` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2014(e)(5)(B)(ii) the method conforms` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
